{"2767860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FPS Pro Team Manager", "steam_appid": 2767860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and manage the team of FPS players of your dreams, create your own strategies and rise to the top of the world's elite. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit and train the team of your dreams:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your favourite players from the hundreds available to create the line-up you've always dreamed of. Create their match and training schedules to keep them improving in the areas you've chosen. Are you going to train your favorite player with a sniper rifle or rather recruit one directly on the market? Why not recruit young talents and take them to the top with you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/8821397acb1f3d7b2695e29ebe4169e9.poster.avif?t=1784912498\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/8821397acb1f3d7b2695e29ebe4169e9.webm?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/8821397acb1f3d7b2695e29ebe4169e9.mp4?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match simulations:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master the game's money system to buy your players the most useful weapons at the right time. Force them to buy every round? Save up to buy your best player a sniper rifle? The choice is yours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose the tactics to be used during the rounds from those you have created or from those that already exist. And why not take inspiration from your opponents' tactics? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Register your team for the tournaments that are most interesting to you, from the smallest local LAN to the biggest major tournaments. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/bc28747e05e45b410a0864896e19bcf7.poster.avif?t=1784912498\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/bc28747e05e45b410a0864896e19bcf7.webm?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/bc28747e05e45b410a0864896e19bcf7.mp4?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactics editor:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create the tactics of your dreams and train your team on them to become more and more effective. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player movement, grenade usage, and every tactical detail are fully customizable, allowing you to create the wildest strategies for your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/d6157266bb2a6efc6124144f896e58bc.poster.avif?t=1784912498\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/d6157266bb2a6efc6124144f896e58bc.webm?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/d6157266bb2a6efc6124144f896e58bc.mp4?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your sponsors and finances:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your sponsors' targets and deadlines to boost your finances and progress to the highest level. Be careful, though, if you don't achieve your objectives.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop integration lets you easily install and manage mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your database and starting date to play with the next generation of rising stars or relive the greatest moments of legendary players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and manage the team of FPS players of your dreams, create your own strategies and rise to the top of the world's elite. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit and train the team of your dreams:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your favourite players from the hundreds available to create the line-up you've always dreamed of. Create their match and training schedules to keep them improving in the areas you've chosen. Are you going to train your favorite player with a sniper rifle or rather recruit one directly on the market? Why not recruit young talents and take them to the top with you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/8821397acb1f3d7b2695e29ebe4169e9.poster.avif?t=1784912498\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/8821397acb1f3d7b2695e29ebe4169e9.webm?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/8821397acb1f3d7b2695e29ebe4169e9.mp4?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match simulations:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master the game's money system to buy your players the most useful weapons at the right time. Force them to buy every round? Save up to buy your best player a sniper rifle? The choice is yours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose the tactics to be used during the rounds from those you have created or from those that already exist. And why not take inspiration from your opponents' tactics? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Register your team for the tournaments that are most interesting to you, from the smallest local LAN to the biggest major tournaments. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/bc28747e05e45b410a0864896e19bcf7.poster.avif?t=1784912498\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/bc28747e05e45b410a0864896e19bcf7.webm?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/bc28747e05e45b410a0864896e19bcf7.mp4?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactics editor:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create the tactics of your dreams and train your team on them to become more and more effective. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player movement, grenade usage, and every tactical detail are fully customizable, allowing you to create the wildest strategies for your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/d6157266bb2a6efc6124144f896e58bc.poster.avif?t=1784912498\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/d6157266bb2a6efc6124144f896e58bc.webm?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/extras/d6157266bb2a6efc6124144f896e58bc.mp4?t=1784912498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your sponsors and finances:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet your sponsors' targets and deadlines to boost your finances and progress to the highest level. Be careful, though, if you don't achieve your objectives.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop integration lets you easily install and manage mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your database and starting date to play with the next generation of rising stars or relive the greatest moments of legendary players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "Recruit and manage the team of FPS players of your dreams, create your own strategies and rise to the top of the world's elite.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/99a22029171863753449fe5208070a7acab5516c/header.jpg?t=1784912498", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/75efb2e20d03057a1201844a463db2f7b4f209e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784912498", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767860/75efb2e20d03057a1201844a463db2f7b4f209e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784912498", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"